WEBVTT

00:02.567 --> 00:07.067
Before the meeting, drop in the agenda, the last minutes and your work list.

00:07.833 --> 00:12.333
Watchkeeper reads them, and writes a meeting brief, in Word and PDF.

00:13.100 --> 00:17.867
Missing information is flagged in yellow, so you can chase it before you walk in.

00:18.633 --> 00:22.100
And it suggests the questions you should be ready to answer.
